{'symbol': 'BWA', 'date': '2021-10-06 09:00:00', 'title': 'BORGWARNER VICE PRESIDENT INDUCTED INTO WOMEN IN MANUFACTURING HALL OF FAME', 'text': "AUBURN HILLS, MICH., OCT. 6, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BORGWARNER'S ARVIS WILLIAMS, VICE PRESIDENT OF GLOBAL QUALITY, MANUFACTURING AND PROGRAM MANAGEMENT, HAS BEEN INDUCTED INTO THE 2021 CLASS OF WOMEN IN MANUFACTURING (WIM) HALL OF FAME."}